        <span data-key="Debian packages and Mint build tools">@Localizer["Debian packages and Mint build tools"]</span>
        <span data-key="Mint uses Debian packages, metapackages that group dependencies, and its own project tools to build the desktop. This is an established way to organize a distribution; using a different project format does not imply missing user features.">@Localizer["Mint uses Debian packages, metapackages that group dependencies, and its own project tools to build the desktop. This is an established way to organize a distribution; using a different project format does not imply missing user features."]</span>
        <span data-key="Package build and archive testing tools">@Localizer["Package build and archive testing tools"]</span>
